    "body": "Please use `context_path` throughout to ensure a test can properly mock the file. Perhaps just combine the `read_file` and `exists` checks?\r\n```rust\r\nif let Ok(cgroup_content) = crate::utils::read_file(context_path(context, \"/proc/1/cgroup\")) {\r\n    if cgroup_content.contains(\"/docker\") {\r\n        // Docker\r\n        return Some(\"Docker\".into());\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\nAnd in case you have trouble writing a test, I would be glad to help.",
